# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Soo-saar qor: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ([''] tccompare: ['']), sadar-cusub.
